# Redirect rules for the static site.
#
# Read by Cloudflare Pages and Netlify from the publish directory, same as
# _headers next to it. Vercel does NOT read this file -- it uses the
# "redirects" key in vercel.json, which stays in place while Vercel is still
# deploying this repo.
#
# Without this, both hostnames serve the site and split the canonical URL.
# Netlify auto-redirects domain aliases to the primary domain; Cloudflare
# Pages does not, so the rule has to be explicit here.

https://www.nearmatch.in/*  https://nearmatch.in/:splat  301
